Run Worker locally

set in wrangler.toml:

BACKEND_URL = "http://localhost:3000"

Then run:

cd flexforge-edge
wrangler dev --local
# worker on http://localhost:8787


Test through the Worker (not directly to backend)

curl -i http://localhost:8787/health
curl -i http://localhost:8787/api/video/abc/enrichment


If this works, your proxy/cors/routing basics are correct.